  ["forever.druid-balance.s4"] = "Moonkin Form comes at 40 with your thirty-first point, Hurricane for a crowd and Innervate for your mana. Wrath still starts Eclipse, and Improved Starfire makes the Starfires after it faster. You cannot heal in Moonkin Form, so shift out to do it.",
  ["forever.druid-balance.s4.between1.if"] = "out of Moonkin Form, after a fight",
