  ["forever.druid-feral-bear.s1.rarely1.why"] = "it holds one still while you finish the first",
  ["forever.druid-feral-bear.s2"] = "Bear Form comes at 10 and you hold monsters from the first dungeon. Growl pulls a monster off your healer, Swipe takes a pack, and Demoralizing Roar makes them hit softer. Your first points go to Ferocity and Feral Instinct.",
  ["forever.druid-feral-bear.s2.between1.if"] = "after a fight, if you are hurt",
  ["forever.druid-feral-bear.s2.between1.why"] = "it heals while you drink",
