  ["forever.druid-feral-bear.s3"] = "Lacerate comes with your sixteenth point, at 25, and it is the threat button. Challenging Roar comes at 28 and Frenzied Regeneration at 36. Stack Lacerate on the monster that matters, Swipe the rest, and keep Growl for the one on your healer.",
