  ["forever.druid-feral-bear.s4"] = "Dire Bear Form comes at 40 and replaces Bear Form, with more health and armour. Primal Bite is your thirty-first point, a heavy bite on a short cooldown, and Barkskin comes at 44. Lacerate stays up, Primal Bite goes on cooldown, and Swipe takes the rest.",
