  ["forever.druid-restoration.s3.low2.why"] = "mana from drinking is cheap, and a pull on empty is not",
  ["forever.druid-restoration.s3.opening1.if"] = "before the first pull",
  ["forever.druid-restoration.s3.opening1.why"] = "it raises your armour for an hour",
  ["forever.druid-restoration.s3.opening2.if"] = "on the tank, before each pull",
  ["forever.druid-restoration.s3.opening2.why"] = "it hurts every monster that hits them",
  ["forever.druid-restoration.s3.opening3.if"] = "on the tank, before the pull",
  ["forever.druid-restoration.s3.opening3.why"] = "it heals before the first hit lands",
  ["forever.druid-restoration.s3.opening4.if"] = "on the tank, if the pull is hard",
  ["forever.druid-restoration.s3.opening4.why"] = "it heals now and keeps healing",
  ["forever.druid-restoration.s3.rarely1.if"] = "when the whole party is hurt, from 30",
  ["forever.druid-restoration.s3.rarely1.why"] = "it heals all of them over a few seconds",
  ["forever.druid-restoration.s3.rarely2.if"] = "to bring back a dead player in a fight",
  ["forever.druid-restoration.s3.rarely2.why"] = "it raises them at once, with a long wait after",
  ["forever.druid-restoration.s3.rarely3.if"] = "when a poison is on someone",
  ["forever.druid-restoration.s3.rarely3.why"] = "it takes the poison off",
  ["forever.druid-restoration.s3.rarely4.if"] = "when a curse is on someone, from 24",
  ["forever.druid-restoration.s3.rarely4.why"] = "it takes the curse off",
  ["forever.druid-restoration.s4"] = "Wild Growth comes at 40 with your thirty-first point, Innervate too, and Barkskin at 44. Rejuvenation on the tank and Swiftmend for the emergency do most of the work, and Wild Growth is for a party that is all hurt, because it costs a lot.",
  ["forever.druid-restoration.s4.between1.if"] = "after a fight, if you are hurt",
  ["forever.druid-restoration.s4.between1.why"] = "it heals while you drink",
  ["forever.druid-restoration.s4.between2.if"] = "out of a fight, on a dead player",
