  ["forever.hunter-beast-mastery.s3.rarely6.why"] = "it comes back with a little health",
  ["forever.hunter-beast-mastery.s4"] = "Bestial Wrath at 40 is a burst for your pet. Volley comes at 40 for packs and Explosive Trap at 34 for groups. Mortal Shots at 60 completes the Marksmanship points.",
