  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.s3"] = "Aimed Shot comes at 20 and Rapid Fire at 26. Trueshot Aura is yours at 25, so keep it on. Your pet holds threat less well than in Beast Mastery, so open from far away and let it get there first.",
