  ["forever.hunter-marksmanship.s4"] = "Sniper Shot at 40 is the opener: cast it first, with the pet already on the monster. Volley comes at 40 and Explosive Trap at 34 for packs. Efficiency and Rapid Recuperation keep your mana up.",
