  ["forever.hunter-survival.split"] = "when to switch. Vareion levels it from 10 and says to wait until 30 for the core, Icy Veins goes through Marksmanship first and switches at the middle of the tree, Maxroll says it is not really playable until about 40. This order is Vareion's. Feor's end-game build leaves Deflection out and takes Improved Stings.",
  ["forever.hunter.advice.damage"] = "Beast Mastery is the build this page advises, because every guide calls it the easiest Hunter to level and Summon Hawk comes at 25. The price: much of your damage rides on the pet, so a dead pet costs you. Marksmanship shoots harder itself and Survival fights up close. Both are slower to level.",
  ["forever.hunter.ov.bad"] = "Mana, and the pet. A long fight runs you dry. A dead pet leaves you in melee, where a Hunter is weak, and ranged shots cannot be used inside 8 yards.",
  ["forever.hunter.ov.good"] = "Killing at range, one monster at a time. You can slow what runs at you, freeze one monster in a trap, and play dead when a pull goes wrong. Levelling is quick, and Beast Mastery is the quickest.",
  ["forever.hunter.ov.levelling"] = "Mark the monster, send the pet in and shoot from range. Tame a boar at 10, mend it after a fight and feed it when it is unhappy. Beast Mastery is the quickest to level, Marksmanship is slower, and Survival comes online between 30 and 40.",
  ["forever.hunter.ov.resource"] = "Mana. Auto Shot costs none, so keep it firing and spend mana on the shots that matter. It returns slowly while you rest, so drink between fights. Efficiency makes shots cheaper, and Rapid Recuperation and Resourcefulness keep your mana coming back while you fight.",
  ["forever.hunter.ov.ten"] = "You get your first talent point and pick a spec. Beast Mastery levels fastest, Marksmanship leans on your own shots and trusts the pet less, Survival fights up close. Your pet quest is at 10 too, and a respec costs gold.",
  ["forever.hunter.ov.who"] = "You shoot from far away and send a pet in front of you. The craft is distance: every pull starts at the edge of your range, and the pet keeps the monster from walking to you.",
  ["forever.hunter.role.damage"] = "Every guide calls Beast Mastery the easiest and fastest to level. Summon Hawk comes at 25 and Bestial Wrath at 40.",
  ["forever.mage"] = "Mana is the whole class. Every cast spends it, and a cast that is resisted still spent it. Frostbolt is yours at 4, Frost Nova at 10, Blink and Evocation at 20. Every line below is a cast or a move, and most of them start with distance.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.dry"] = "Arcane Blast costs more every time you cast it. Stop when the bar says to stop.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.intro"] = "Arcane has become a build of stacks. Arcane Blast hits harder and costs more with each cast, Arcane Wrath hits hard between stacks, and Missile Barrage turns procs into free Arcane Missiles. It needs mana more than anything.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.line"] = "Arcane Blast stacks, Arcane Wrath and Arcane Missiles on Missile Barrage. Hits hard, and runs dry.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.note"] = "(36 points in Arcane, 3 in Frost, then 12 in Fire.)",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p1"] = "Your Arcane Missiles, Arcane Blast and Arcane Wrath sometimes keep casting when you are hit. Five points here also open the tree's second row.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p10"] = "Arcane spells crit more often, and Arcane Mind makes those crits count.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p11"] = "Makes your next spell instant. Use it for an Arcane Wrath you cannot stand still for, and it is the gate to Arcane Power.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p12"] = "More intellect, so more mana and more damage, and Arcane crits do extra damage.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p13"] = "Your spells do more damage and crit more often, whatever they are.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p14"] = "The fifth and last rank of Arcane Mind.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p15"] = "Arcane crits come more often, and Arcane Mind makes each one count.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p16"] = "For a short while your spells do more damage and cost more mana. Press it with a full bar on a monster worth it.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p17"] = "The last rank of the crit chance.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p18"] = "Fire tail. Fire Blast, Ice Lance, Arcane Blast and Scorch crit more often, and Arcane Blast is on that list. It also opens Fire's second row.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p19"] = "Shortens Fireball, Frostfire Bolt and Arcane Wrath, so Arcane Wrath casts faster.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p2"] = "Arcane Blast and Frostbolt sometimes make your next Arcane Missiles shorter and free. Cast the Missiles when it lights up.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p20"] = "Fire Blast comes back sooner and reaches farther. A finisher you can cast while you move.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p21"] = "Arcane spells reach farther, which means more casts before a monster arrives.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p22"] = "A little resistance, and a fully resisted spell gives some mana back. These are the last points, and nothing better is left.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p3"] = "Your spells are resisted less, and your Arcane casts pull less attention. Two small points while the better ones are out of reach.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p4"] = "Your damage spells sometimes make the next spell free. It starts here and fills out at 24.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p5"] = "The build's main spell. Each cast adds spell damage and makes the next one cost more, up to 4 stacks, and the stacks fall after a while.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p6"] = "Fewer misses on every spell. It sits in Frost, and a resisted Arcane Blast is the dearest miss you have.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p7"] = "More chances at a free spell. It has to be full before Arcane Meditation can be taken.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p8"] = "A slow, hard hit that grows with your mana bar. It needs Arcane Blast, and it is cast at full stacks.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.p9"] = "Part of your mana regeneration continues while you cast. It needs Arcane Concentration at full, and it is how this build keeps casting.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.s1"] = "Before your first talent point. The same kit in every build.",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.s1.between1.if"] = "when your bags have none",
  ["forever.mage-arcane.s1.between1.why"] = "drinking is how your mana comes back",
