  ["forever.paladin-holy.split"] = "when to leave Holy. Mobalytics' order, used here, puts the 31 healing points first. Icy Veins levels in Retribution (Benediction, Holy Conduit, Improved Judgement, Pursuit of Justice) and moves into Holy later, and Warcraft Tavern calls healing while levelling not recommended.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.dry"] = "A monster still on you after 20 seconds means the job is working.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.intro"] = "Protection holds monsters on you and stays up. Seal of Fury makes Judgement a taunt, Holy Shield makes a block threat, and Consecration holds a pack. It is a shield and a magic tank, and mana is its limit.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.line"] = "Holds the monsters on you with a shield. Slow to quest alone, strong in a group.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.note"] = "(35 points in Protection, 16 in Retribution: 12 first for Pursuit of Justice, 4 last.)",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.p1"] = "More parry, so fewer hits land, and a parry brings your next swing sooner. A hit that misses makes no work for the healer.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.p10"] = "More armour from your gear, so every hit is smaller.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.p11"] = "A second Judgement of your seal with a cooldown of its own. With Seal of Fury it is a second taunt, and it does not use up the seal.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.p12"] = "While Righteous Fury is on, you take less damage from everything. Keep it on in a group.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.p13"] = "More block for a short time and Holy damage on every block, which is threat. It is the button to press whenever its charges run out.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.p14"] = "A block can give you a free attack, and it stores several. More swings are more threat.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.p15"] = "More Defense, so you are hit and critically hit less. Guides say these points can move to Toughness or Guardian's Favor.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.p16"] = "Holy Strike makes more threat, and with Righteous Fury on it also cuts the damage you take for a few seconds.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.p17"] = "Holy Strike comes back sooner and strikes with your shield, so Holy Shield and Shield Specialization fire from it. You can also block spells for a time.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.p18"] = "Judgement sometimes gives back part of the seal's mana, so you drink less. More points make it likelier.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.p19"] = "Holy Strike hits harder and refreshes the Judgement on its target. It is the last Retribution point of the build.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.p2"] = "Judgement comes back sooner. It is a taunt with Seal of Fury, so a shorter wait is more control.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.p3"] = "Your spells and attacks crit more often. It costs 3 points on the way to Pursuit of Justice.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.p4"] = "You run and ride faster. Icy Veins goes through Retribution for this before it goes back to Protection.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.p5"] = "A hit on you sometimes raises your chance to block for a while. It is what makes the shield worth carrying, and Shield Specialization needs all 5.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.p6"] = "You miss less. A tank's threat is Holy damage, and a missed attack makes none.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.p7"] = "Divine Shield, Divine Protection and Templar's Bulwark come back sooner, and Forbearance ends sooner.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.p8"] = "A shield worth your full health for a few seconds, for the one big hit. It shares Forbearance with Divine Protection, so use one or the other.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.p9"] = "Your shield absorbs more, and a block can give back some mana. Mana is what limits a tank.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.s1"] = "Before your first talent point. The same kit in every build. A seal does most of your damage, and Judgement does not use it up, so use both.",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.s1.between1.if"] = "after a fight, if you are hurt",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.s1.between1.why"] = "the cast is slow, so wait until nothing hits you",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.s1.between2.if"] = "after a fight, before the next pull",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.s1.between2.text"] = "Sit and drink",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.s1.between2.why"] = "mana from drinking is cheap, and a pull on empty is not",
  ["forever.paladin-protection.s1.big"] = "keep it for the fight that would kill you",
