  ["forever.paladin-retribution.s4"] = "Hammer of the Righteous at 40 and Hammer of Wrath at 44 round out the kit. With Unsealed Wrath, change seals in a long fight so the stored copies fire. Champion of the Light makes Intellect worth wearing.",
  ["forever.paladin-retribution.s4.between1.if"] = "when you need a heal in a hurry",
