  ["forever.priest-discipline.s3"] = "Holy Fire and Flash Heal come at 20, Prayer of Healing at 30 and Shadow Word: Death at 32. Penance at 35 is the reason you chose this tree: cast it on a monster or on the tank, whenever it is ready.",
