  ["forever.priest-discipline.split"] = "whether to keep Spirit Tap and the wand. Feyo's 30 to 60 order, used here, keeps both. His level 60 build and Warcraft Tavern's drop them for 20 points in Holy, which costs a respec. Maxroll would delay Spirit Tap to reach Penance sooner.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.dry"] = "A heal that overheals is mana you drink again.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.intro"] = "Holy heals with Renew, Heal and Prayer of Mending. Divine Fury makes Smite and Heal quicker, Holy Nova is the only area spell early, and Prayer of Mending at 47 is its signature. It is the dungeon healer, and it levels slowly alone.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.line"] = "Renew, Heal and Prayer of Mending. A dungeon healer, slow alone.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.note"] = "(32 points in Holy, 14 in Discipline and 5 in Shadow for the wand and mana.)",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p1"] = "Your wand does 25% more damage. It costs no mana, so most early kills end with it.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p10"] = "Smite, Holy Fire, Holy Nova and Prayer of Healing reach 10% further. A cheap point on the way to the lower talents.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p11"] = "Lesser Heal, Heal, Greater Heal, Penance and Prayer of Mending cost less mana. Your big heals are your mana bill, so this is the saving.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p12"] = "Part of your Spirit becomes healing and damage. You already stack Spirit for mana, so it works twice.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p13"] = "All your healing is a little stronger. Nothing clever, and it counts on every heal you cast.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p14"] = "If you die you heal for 15 seconds at no mana cost. It also opens the way to Prayer of Mending.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p15"] = "You regain mana when a heal differs from your last one. Alternate Renew, Flash Heal and Heal and the mana comes back.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p16"] = "Heals the target the next time it takes damage, then jumps to another party member, up to 5 times. Cast it on the tank whenever it is ready.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p17"] = "You regain mana when a heal differs from your last one. Alternate Renew, Flash Heal and Heal and the mana comes back.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p18"] = "Your instant spells deal and heal more. Renew is instant, so it helps the heal you cast the most.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p19"] = "More Intellect, which is more mana and a little more critical chance.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p2"] = "Kills sometimes double your Spirit for 15 seconds, and half your mana regeneration continues while you cast for that time. It is why you drink so little.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p20"] = "Half your mana regeneration keeps going while you cast. A healer casts all the time, so this is the mana talent that matters most.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p21"] = "Your next spell costs nothing and crits more often. Put it on Greater Heal or Prayer of Healing when the big hit comes.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p3"] = "Your spells keep their cast time when you are hit, most of the time. Pushback ends more heals than any monster does.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p4"] = "Renew heals more. It is the heal you put on the tank before the pull, so it gains from every rank you add.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p5"] = "Smite, Holy Fire, Heal and Greater Heal cast half a second faster. That is a big part of a Heal's cast time, and the heal lands sooner.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p6"] = "Hurts every monster within 10 yards and heals your party. It is the only area damage spell a levelling Priest has.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p7"] = "Renew heals more. It is the heal you put on the tank before the pull, so it gains from every rank you add.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p8"] = "A critical heal raises the target's armour for 15 seconds. It helps the tank, and it costs you nothing.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.p9"] = "Flash Heal on someone else also heals you for half as much, and makes no threat. Healing the tank keeps you up too.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.s1"] = "Before your first talent point. The same kit in every build. Get a wand as soon as you can, because from 5 it does most of your killing.",
  ["forever.priest-holy.s1.between1.if"] = "after a fight, if you are hurt",
