  ["forever.priest-holy.split"] = "where to start. Feyo's order, used here, opens with the wand and Spirit Tap to level. Icy Veins and the Warcraft Tavern build skip them for Twilight Focus and Improved Renew, and the wowforeverbuilds healing plans do the same.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.dry"] = "The wand is your cheapest damage, so a full mana bar is a choice.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.intro"] = "Shadow wins with Pain, Plague and Mind Blast and ends fights with the wand. Spirit Tap returns your mana after kills, Mind Flay replaces Smite, and Shadowform at 42 makes every Shadow spell half price and harder hitting. Guides call it the best Priest to level alone.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.line"] = "Pain, Plague and Mind Blast, then the wand. The best Priest to level alone, and no heals in Shadowform.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.note"] = "(37 points in Shadow, then 14 in Discipline: the wand first, and Twin Disciplines, Mental Strength and Meditation at the end.)",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p1"] = "Your wand does 25% more damage. It costs no mana, so most early kills end with it.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p10"] = "Mind Blast comes back sooner. It is your hardest hit, so a shorter wait is more damage.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p11"] = "Silences a caster for 5 seconds and cuts its cast short. It is your one interrupt, so keep it for the spell that hurts.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p12"] = "Mind Blast comes back sooner. At full ranks it is ready 2.5 seconds earlier than it was.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p13"] = "Your Shadow spells reach 20% further. More range is more free casts before the monster arrives.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p14"] = "10% more Shadow damage at full ranks. It is the biggest plain damage gain in the tree, and it sits just before Shadowform.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p15"] = "Shadow damage up 10%, Shadow spells cost half, critical hits hit harder and physical damage falls by 15%. You cannot cast heals in it.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p16"] = "Your Shadow spells miss less. By now every cast is a Shadow spell, so a miss costs you more than anywhere else.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p17"] = "Devouring Plague costs half, and when its target dies the plague jumps to 2 monsters nearby. Plague the one that will die first.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p18"] = "Your instant spells hit harder. Pain, Plague and Death are all instant, so most of your damage over time grows.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p19"] = "More Intellect, which is more mana and a little more critical chance.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p2"] = "Kills sometimes double your Spirit for 15 seconds, and half your mana regeneration continues while you cast for that time. It is why you drink so little.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p20"] = "Half your mana regeneration keeps going while you cast. Spirit then works in a fight and not only between them.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p21"] = "Shadow Word: Death crits more often on a monster at 20% health or less. It is your finisher, so it should kill.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p22"] = "More Intellect, which is more mana and a little more critical chance.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p3"] = "Shadow Word: Pain lasts 6 seconds longer. More damage for the same mana, on a monster you leave to the wand.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p4"] = "Your Shadow spells miss less. A miss costs the same mana as a hit, so this pays you back at once.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p5"] = "A channelled spell that slows the monster by half. It replaces Smite as the spell you cast between Mind Blasts.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p6"] = "Each tick of Mind Flay hits harder than the one before it, so a full channel is worth waiting for.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p7"] = "Mind Blast comes back sooner. It is your hardest hit, so a shorter wait is more damage.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p8"] = "You and your party heal for part of the Shadow damage you do. It is also the way down to Shadowform.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.p9"] = "Each Shadow spell makes the monster take more Shadow damage from you, up to 5 times. The longer the fight, the more it pays.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.s1"] = "Before your first talent point. The same kit in every build. Get a wand as soon as you can, because from 5 it does most of your killing.",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.s1.between1.if"] = "after a fight, if you are hurt",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.s1.between1.why"] = "it heals while you drink",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.s1.between2.if"] = "after a fight, before the next pull",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.s1.between2.text"] = "Sit and drink",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.s1.between2.why"] = "mana from drinking is cheap, and a pull on empty is not",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.s1.loop1.if"] = "when your health is low",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.s1.loop1.why"] = "a heal costs less than a death",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.s1.loop2.if"] = "on a monster that will live a while",
  ["forever.priest-shadow.s1.loop2.why"] = "it keeps hurting it while you wand",
