  ["forever.rogue-subtlety.s3"] = "Poisons at 20, Premeditation at 25 and Ghostly Strike at 27 give you the opener. Hemorrhage at 32 is the strike you press from then on.",
  ["forever.rogue-subtlety.s3.between1.if"] = "when the coating is gone",
