  ["forever.shaman-enhancement.split"] = "mana against speed. Icy Veins would start in Restoration for Mindfulness and Water Shield and respec at 25. Nicktew calls that a mistake, because Stormstrike should come as early as it can. The order here is Nicktew's, with Mindfulness and Water Shield after Improved Stormstrike.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.dry"] = "A heal that lands early beats a bigger heal that lands late.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.intro"] = "Restoration heals a group with Healing Wave, Riptide and Chain Heal, and fills the gaps with totems. It is for dungeons and for playing with a friend. Alone it is the slowest way to level.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.line"] = "Healing Wave, Riptide and Chain Heal, with totems. A healer for a group, slow alone.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.note"] = "(46 points in Restoration, 5 in Enhancement for Intellect.)",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p1"] = "Healing Wave casts faster. It is the heal you cast most, and a quicker cast lands before the damage does.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p10"] = "Your next Nature spell, Healing Wave among them, becomes instant. It is the emergency button.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p11"] = "Healing Wave heals for much more. It is the spell you cast most, and Riptide needs this talent.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p12"] = "A critical heal gives your target more armour for a while. It is the last point of a row you had to pass.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p13"] = "Every healing spell heals 10% more. It is the biggest plain gain on the tree.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p14"] = "A heal over time that makes Chain Heal stronger on the same target. Put it on the hurt, then Chain Heal them.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p15"] = "Your healing spells crit more often, and a crit gives back mana through Water Shield.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p16"] = "Totems cost less mana at full ranks. You drop several in a dungeon.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p17"] = "Mana Spring Totem and Healing Stream Totem work 5% better a point. It helps the whole group.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p18"] = "Intellect: more mana to heal with, and more spell critical chance. Nothing left in Restoration helps you more.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p2"] = "Some of your mana regeneration keeps going while you cast. A healer casts all the time, so this keeps you healing.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p3"] = "Healing costs 5% less at full ranks, and spells hit more often. These points lead to Water Shield.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p4"] = "Globes of water give back mana when you are hit or land a critical strike. Only one shield holds, so it replaces Lightning Shield.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p5"] = "Tidal Focus at full strength: healing costs 5% less and you hit more often with spells.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p6"] = "A critical heal gives your target more armour for a while. One point opens the way to Mana Tide Totem.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p7"] = "Mana Tide Totem gives your whole group mana back, on a long cooldown. Press it when the group runs low.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p8"] = "Being hit while you cast has a good chance of not slowing your heals. Fewer ruined casts.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.p9"] = "A critical heal gives your target more armour for a while. It takes the points Nature's Swiftness asks for.",
  ["forever.shaman-restoration.s1"] = "Before your first talent point. The same kit in every build.",
