  ["forever.warlock-demonology.split"] = "the Affliction points. Kargoz takes one point of Corruption at 10 and finishes it after 41, and he says a start in Affliction with a respec at 35 is also good. Warcraft Tavern would respec at 27. Crix's page has a Demonology tab that could not be read. The last point is ours.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.dry"] = "Until Shadow and Flame, Conflagrate eats the Immolate, so cast it late in the burn.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.intro"] = "Destruction casts big hits and finishes with instants. It kills fast when the mana lasts, and the mana does not last. Guides call it the slowest Warlock to level.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.line"] = "Immolate, Conflagrate, Shadowburn and Incinerate. Hits hard, drinks mana, and is slow to level.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.note"] = "(33 points in Destruction, then 14 in Affliction and 4 in Demonology.)",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.p1"] = "Shadow Bolt and Immolate cast faster, and Incinerate will too. Everything you do in this build is a cast, so it comes first.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.p10"] = "Every Destruction spell hits a little harder, and Searing Pain crits more often. It lifts everything you cast.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.p11"] = "Conflagrate makes your Shadow damage stronger for a while, and Shadowburn does the same for Fire. Keep both ready and you hit harder all fight.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.p12"] = "Your filler from now on: a Fire hit that does more on a monster burning from Immolate. It takes over from Shadow Bolt as the cast you press most.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.p13"] = "Conflagrate makes your Shadow damage stronger for a while, and Shadowburn does the same for Fire. Keep both ready and you hit harder all fight.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.p14"] = "Fewer missed spells and less threat on you. A missed Incinerate is a whole cast wasted.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.p15"] = "Life Tap gives more mana. This build runs short of mana, so more per tap means fewer stops to drink.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.p16"] = "Corruption casts faster. It is the damage over time spell you keep on every monster beside Immolate and Bane of Agony.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.p17"] = "Your next Bane of Agony is stronger. It is a spare point once the rest is taken.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.p18"] = "Crits from Corruption and Bane of Agony hit much harder. The build keeps both on a monster, so you feel it.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.p19"] = "Your demon hits harder. The last spare points go to the demon, since it fights on while you cast.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.p2"] = "Immolate hits harder when you cast it, and Conflagrate later slows the monster. Immolate opens every pull.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.p3"] = "An instant blast that gives a shard back if the monster dies soon after. Use it to finish a monster that would take one more cast.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.p4"] = "Your Destruction spells cost less mana. This build casts almost everything and runs short of mana, so it matters.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.p5"] = "Critical hits from your Destruction spells hit much harder. A crit becomes a large part of your damage.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.p6"] = "An instant hit on a monster burning from Immolate, and it uses the Immolate up until Shadow and Flame. Cast it late so little is lost.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.p7"] = "Critical hits from your Destruction spells hit much harder. A crit becomes a large part of your damage.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.p8"] = "Part of the damage you do to other monsters also hits the one carrying it. Put it on a second monster and the first one's damage reaches it.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.p9"] = "Conflagrate crits far more often, and it is the instant you press whenever it is ready.",
  ["forever.warlock-destruction.s1"] = "Before your first talent point. The same kit in every build.",
